cubegin

This package re-exports Cubegin TNoodle-compatible scramble packages:

- @cubegin/scramble-core
- @cubegin/scramble-image
- @cubegin/scramble-puzzle

Those packages port behavior from thewca/tnoodle-lib lib-scrambles v0.19.2,
which is distributed under GPL-v3.0. FTO puzzle-state plus training solver
behavior also references GPL-v3.0 source from cs0x7f/cstimer at commit
22a6aedde88fd59255ab6a8ae8c06180e7a55d64. Training taxonomy was cross-checked
against GPL-v3 DCTimer-Android at commit
fe806bd28953276cea2fe8d2cbd2f227a27d3f2f. Cubegin is not an official WCA
scramble program.
